<title>USA: Oncogene, Sepracor say in pact.</title>
<headline>Oncogene, Sepracor say in pact.</headline>
<dateline>UNIONDALE, N.Y. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oncogene Science Inc and Sepracor Inc said Wednesday that they have formed a collaborative research, development and commercialization co-venture for the discovery of novel small molecule drugs, targeting selected indications using Oncogene Science's drug discovery technologies.</p>
</text>
